        "id": "harumasa-dash_attack-hiten_no_tsuru_slash",
        "name": "Hiten no Tsuru - Slash (Dash Attack)",
        "description": "While there are /bX-Marked//b enemies on the field, Harumasa will enter the /bAwakened//b state, switching /bDash Attack: Hiten no Tsuru//b for /bDash Attack: Hiten no Tsuru - Slash//b.\n\nWhile in the /bAwakened//b state, press [BASIC] during a dodge to activate:\n\nRush forwards to the closest /bX-Marked//b enemy and execute a powerful slash, dealing Electric DMG. When the slash hits the target, it consumes 2 stacks of /bElectro Prison//b. With less than 2 stacks of /bElectro Prison//b, /bX-Marked//b will be removed from the enemy. Before /bX-Marked//b is removed, repeatedly press [BASIC] to repeatedly use /bDash Attack: Hiten no Tsuru - Slash//b. While no /bX-Marked//b enemies exist on the field, Harumasa leaves the /bAwakened//b state.\n\nWhile in the /bAwakened//b state, press [BASIC] after /bBasic Attack: Falling Feather//b to quickly follow up with /bDash Attack: Hiten no Tsuru - Slash//b. During skill activation, Anti-Interrupt level increases, and DMG taken is reduced by 40%..",
